Title: Neon Courier - Episode 4 "Fallout"

EXT. CITY STREETS - NIGHT

Mira, in her black leather courier jacket, walks the streets. Juno at her side.

JUNO
Voss has a daughter. Elena. She's his weak spot.

MIRA
How do you know that?

JUNO
Trust me.

EXT. HIGHWAY - NIGHT

Mira guns her motorbike down the highway, Kai riding behind her.

KAI
So the locket opens the vault, right?

MIRA
Who told you that?

INT. UNDERGROUND GARAGE - LATER

Rook steps out of the darkness, chrome arm gleaming.

ROOK
Miss me?

SMASH TO BLACK.
